        "label": "Thesis",
        "notes": "Complete two quarters of mentored research (Ecology and Evolutionary Biology 198A and 198B) with a full-time department faculty member, producing a senior thesis. Students must formally present their work at Ecology and Evolutionary Biology Research Day or UCLA Undergraduate Research Week."
       },
       {
        "type": "all",
        "items": [
         {
          "type": "course",
          "code": "EE BIOL 199",
          "status": "inactive"
         }
        ],
        "label": "Project",
        "notes": "Complete one research project-based upper-division ecology and evolutionary biology course to be determined by the undergraduate curriculum committee, combined with at least 4 units of faculty-mentored undergraduate research (Ecology and Evolutionary Biology 199), culminating in a formal paper or report. The 199 units may be completed in one or two quarters. Students must formally present their work at Ecology and Evolutionary Biology Research Day or UCLA Undergraduate Research Week."
       },
